      "body": "## Purpose\r\nResolves #21948 by adding parameterized regression test coverage for parallel sampling (`n > 1`) across `CUMULATIVE`, `DELTA`, and `FINAL_ONLY` output modes in both `LLMEngine` and `AsyncLLM`.\r\n\r\n## Test Plan\r\nAdded parameterized `pytest` functions to verify standard token outputs when `n_outputs=2` is passed to the sampling parameters. \r\n\r\nTests can be executed locally or via CI using:\r\n`pytest tests/v1/engine/test_llm_engine.py -k test_parallel_sampling_llm_engine_output_kinds`\r\n`pytest tests/v1/engine/test_async_llm.py -k test_parallel_sampling_async_engine_output_kinds`\r\n\r\n## Test Result\r\nNew unit tests have been successfully pushed. Relying on automated GitHub Actions CI to execute the suite and validate the parameterized test cases against the fully configured vLLM environment.\r\n\r\n---\r\n<details>\r\n<summary> Essential Elements of an Effective PR Description Checklist </summary>\r\n\r\n- [x] The purpose of the PR, such as \"Fix some issue (link existing issues this PR will resolve)\".\r\n- [x] The test plan, such as providing test command.\r\n- [x] The test results, such as pasting the results comparison before and after, or e2e results.\r\n</details>",
